// P3G.2 (external-references.md ER2.3–ER2.6, ER6.15–ER6.17, ER4.6; derived-and-linking.md
// DV1.3, DV1.4, DV1.11; ex1-step15.png, ex1-step16.png, ex1-step17.png): updating linked
// instances, on the linked-documents block (`cadrs_core::samples::linked_block`): document A
// "Block source" (Part Studio "Block", 50 × 30 × 25 = 37 500 mm³, version V1) and document B
// "Block consumer", whose Assembly 1 holds three instances of A@V1 (`linked-block consumer 3`).
// 01 B's Assembly 1: Part 1 <1>–<3>, each with the plain version (link) icon; its tooltip.
// 02 (ER2.3, ex1-step15) A edited in its own document (Extrude 1 25 → 40) and V2 made
//    (`linked-block edit`): the three rows get the blue update badge, and the tab Assembly 1 a
//    badge left of its name; the geometry is unchanged (25 high).
// 03 a badge's tooltip: "Linked document: Block source › Block (V1)", "V2 is available. Click to
//    update."
// 04 (ER2.5, ex1-step16 left) the three rows selected, right-click → the menu with "Update
//    linked document…" hovered.
// 05 (ER2.4, ex1-step16 right) the Reference manager: Update to latest | Selective update,
//    "Newer versions available for 1 document", the row "Block source" with its thumbnail and
//    "V1 ⇒ V2", the "?" and the blue Update all.
// 06 (ER6.17, ex1-step17) Update all: the blocks are 40 high, the badges are gone, the toast
//    "Updated 3 references" with "show more details" (ER4.6).
// 07 show more details: "Block source: V1 ⇒ V2".
// 08 (ER6.18) mass properties of the three: 3 · 50 · 30 · 40 = 180 000 mm³.
// 09 (DV1.4) Ctrl+Z: one step back, the three at V1 again (badges back, 3 · 37 500 = 112 500 mm³).
// 10 Ctrl+Y: at V2 again. A edited again (depth 55) and V3 made: the badges are back ("V3 is
//    available").
// 11 (ER2.6) right-click the tab Assembly 1: "Update linked document…" hovered.
// 12 the Reference manager for the tab: "Block source V2 ⇒ V3".
// 13 Update all: every reference of the tab at V3 (55 high), no badges.
// 14 (DV1.6) "Block user 2" also links Block source (at V1, `linked-block second-consumer`):
//    Part 1 <1> → Where used…: the references to Block source's Block at a version, in this
//    document (Assembly 1, V3: 3 uses) and in Block user 2 (Assembly 1, V1: 1 use).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Custom("linked-block consumer 3"),
        Key("F"),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-three-linked-instances"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-block edit"),
        Screenshot("02-blue-badges-and-tab-badge"),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-2-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-badge-tooltip"),
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Click(ui("instance-row-2")),
        Click(ui("instance-row-3")),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-1")),
        WaitFor("assembly-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("asm-update-linked")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("04-update-linked-document-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-update-linked")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        Hover(ui("refman-update")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("05-reference-manager"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-updated-to-v2"),
        Click(ui("refman-details")),
        WaitFor("update-details"),
        Screenshot("07-show-more-details"),
        Click(ui("update-details-close")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-mass-180000"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-undo-back-to-v1"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Key("Ctrl+Y"),
        Custom("linked-block edit 55"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-v3-badges"),
        RightClick(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        WaitFor("tab-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("tab-update-linked")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("11-tab-menu-update-linked"),
        Click(ui("tab-update-linked")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-tab-reference-manager"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-tab-updated"),
        Custom("linked-block second-consumer"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-1")),
        WaitFor("assembly-context-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-where-used")),
        WaitFor("where-used-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-where-used-other-documents"),
    ],
)
